      "body": "I fixed the HTML errors in `index.html`. A tag-balance check now finds no unclosed or stray tags and no duplicate IDs. I haven't opened the page in a browser, and nothing is committed.\n\n**Structural fixes**\n- **Research section never closed.** Its `</section>` was inside the comment that hides the \"(Exo)Planetary Science at MSU\" block, so the next three sections (Members, News, Open Positions) were nested inside Research. I moved the `</section>` outside the comment and removed the extra `</section>` after Open Positions that had been closing it.\n- **Presentations section never closed.** I added `</section>` before the Hobbies section.\n- **Software section:** the heading's `<div class=\"row\">` was missing its closing tag. I added it.\n- **Software section:** `<pre>` isn't allowed inside `<p>`, so browsers were closing the paragraphs early and leaving stray `</p>` tags. I changed the two wrapping `<p>` tags to `<div>`. The page should look the same.\n\n**Smaller fixes**\n- Added the missing `</li>` on the Teaching and Software menu items.\n- Added the missing `</p>` at the end of the Research Interests paragraph and the \"Graduate School Application Example\" paragraph.\n- Fixed `(2018)<b>` \u2192 `(2018)</b>` in the NSF fellowship line. It had been making everything after it bold.\n- **Duplicate ID:** the 3I/ATLAS heading used `id=\"uv_planets\"`, the same as the UV planets summary. I changed it to `id=\"atlas\"`, so the \"3I/ATLAS in TESS\" menu link now works. Before, the menu had no matching target for it, and its \"Young planets in the UV\" link hit two headings.\n- Changed bare `<` in text like `(< 300 Myr)` to `&lt;` (11 places).\n- Changed `</nav >` to `</nav>`.\n\n**Left alone (your call)**\n- The \"(Exo)Planetary Science at MSU\" menu link (`#research_1`) goes nowhere, because that section is commented out.\n- Every `<h2>` heading has an `<hr>` inside it. That's technically invalid, but your styling probably relies on it, so I didn't move them.\n- Typos: \"go abour writing\" (~line 650), \"the ability the train\" (~line 806), \"Uniersity\" (~line 340), \"I am to provide a wholistic\" (~line 326).",
